+---------------- THERMAL HYSTERESIS BLOCK ----------------+

  [NTC_HOTSPOT] --> NODE_TH

  NODE_TH --> [U1] Comparator
               IN+ = NODE_TH
               IN- = T_HIGH_REF  (trip temp)

  NODE_TH --> [U2] Comparator
               IN+ = NODE_TH
               IN- = T_LOW_REF   (reset temp)

  U1_OUT = HOT_FAULT
  U2_OUT = COOL_OK

  HOT_FAULT ----[Q1] NPN----> LATCH_FAULT
  COOL_OK  ----[Q2] NPN----> CLEAR_FAULT (only when temp < T_LOW_REF)

  LATCH_FAULT --> DISABLE_DRIVER

  BEHAVIOR:
  - When temp > T_HIGH_REF → HOT_FAULT sets LATCH_FAULT → driver off.
  - Driver stays off until temp < T_LOW_REF → COOL_OK clears latch.
  - Hysteresis prevents rapid on/off chattering around threshold.
